"title": "Jibu la Daudi kwa Viongozi Wasio na Urafiki",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "jibu la daudi kwa viongozi wasio na urafiki",
"language": "swh",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Daudi alipozidi kupata mafanikio, Mfalme Sauli akawa adui yake. Bwana alimkataa Sauli kwa sababu ya kutokuwa mwaminifu kama mfalme, na upako wa Roho Mtakatifu ukakaa juu ya Daudi (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09015001\" data-end-ref=\"09016014\">1 Samweli 15:1–16:14</data>). Sauli alipohitaji mtu wa kutuliza akili yake, Daudi alipiga kinubi na kumtuliza (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09016015\" data-end-ref=\"09016023\">16:15–23</data>). Sauli alipohitaji mtu wa kukabiliana na tishio la Goliathi, Daudi alithibitisha kuwa shujaa kijana mwenye uwezo na mafanikio (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09017001\" data-end-ref=\"09017058\">1 Samweli 17</data>). Wengine walipoona Daudi na kusifu mafanikio yake, Sauli akawa na hofu na wivu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09018006\" data-end-ref=\"09018009\">18:6–9</data>). Wivu wake hivi karibuni ukageuka kuwa hasira, ghadhabu, na chuki ya mauaji.</p><p>Baada ya Mfalme Sauli kujaribu kumuua Daudi kwa mkuki mara mbili (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09018010\" data-end-ref=\"09018011\">1 Samweli 18:10–11</data>), Daudi aliendelea kumtumikia. Aliongoza kikundi cha wanajeshi wa mfalme (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09018013\" data-end-ref=\"09018013\">18:13</data>). Alimuoa binti wa mfalme (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09018017\" data-end-ref=\"09018027\">18:17–27</data>). Alipiga kinubi katika mahakama ya kifalme ya Sauli (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09019007\" data-end-ref=\"09019007\">19:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09019009\" data-end-ref=\"09019009\">9</data>). Daudi aliendelea kufanikiwa katika kila alichofanya, jambo ambalo lilimfanya Sauli kuwa na hofu na mashaka makubwa, na alijaribu kumuua Daudi tena (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09019009\" data-end-ref=\"09019011\">19:9–11</data>). Daudi alilazimika kutoroka ili kuokoa maisha yake (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09019011\" data-end-ref=\"09019018\">19:11–18</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09020001\" data-end-ref=\"09020042\">20:1–42</data>).</p><p>Katika kipindi chote cha utawala wa Mfalme Sauli, Daudi alikuwa mkimbizi, akifuatwa na mfalme ambaye alikuwa amemtumikia kwa uaminifu. Hata hivyo, alikataa kumdhuru Sauli. Mara mbili, Daudi alipata fursa ya kumuua Sauli (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09024001\" data-end-ref=\"09024022\">1 Samweli 24:1–22</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09026001\" data-end-ref=\"09026025\">26:1–25</data>), lakini alikataa kumshambulia “mpakwa mafuta wa BWANA” (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09024006\" data-end-ref=\"09024006\">24:6</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09026009\" data-end-ref=\"09026009\">26:9</data>).</p><p>Katika miaka hii akiwa mkimbizi, Daudi aliendelea kumtumikia Bwana na watu wa Israeli (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09023001\" data-end-ref=\"09023006\">1 Samweli 23:1–6</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09025004\" data-end-ref=\"09025009\">25:4–9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09025014\" data-end-ref=\"09025016\">14–16</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09027008\" data-end-ref=\"09027009\">27:8–9</data>). Daudi aliposikia kwamba Sauli na Yonathani walikuwa wamekufa, aliomboleza sana kwa ajili ya mfalme na mwanawe &quot;mpendwa na mpendekeza&quot; (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10001017\" data-end-ref=\"10001027\">2 Samweli 1:17–27</data>).</p><p>Daudi alibaki mwaminifu kwa mfalme aliyemchukia na kutaka kumuua. Vivyo hivyo, nabii Yeremia aliandika unabii katika korti ya kifalme ambapo waliuchoma na kumweka katika kisima ili afe (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24036021\" data-end-ref=\"24036026\">Yeremia 36:21–26</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24038001\" data-end-ref=\"24038013\">38:1–13</data>). Nabii Danieli na marafiki zake pia waliwatumikia kwa uaminifu katika korti za kifalme za Babeli na Uajemi. Walifanya hivi ingawa wafalme walifanya maamuzi kinyume na imani yao au wao binafsi (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003001\" data-end-ref=\"27003030\">Danieli 3:1–30</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27006001\" data-end-ref=\"27006028\">6:1–28</data>).</p><p>Kuwa mwaminifu chini ya utawala wa adui hakukuleta mafanikio kila wakati. Yesu ni mfano bora wa hili. Mamlaka ya Kiyahudi yalimsaka na hatimaye kumwua. Yesu hakufanikiwa duniani, lakini alimwamini Baba yake wa mbinguni. Mafanikio yake yalikuja baada ya kifo chake katika ufufuo.</p><p>Tunaweza pia kufa tukiwa tunaishi chini ya viongozi wanaotupinga, na huenda tusiona matokeo mazuri kutokana na mateso yetu. Hata hivyo, katika ulimwengu wa baadaye ambao Mungu ataleta, atarekebisha kila kitu kilichokuwa kibaya. Mungu atawazawadia wale wanaobaki waaminifu hata wanapoteseka chini ya viongozi wakatili.</p><p><u>Sehemu za Kujifunza Zaidi</u></p><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09024001\" data-end-ref=\"09024022\">1 Samweli 24:1–22</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10001001\" data-end-ref=\"10001027\">2 Samweli 1:1–27</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10011001\" data-end-ref=\"10011027\">11:1–27</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24036021\" data-end-ref=\"24036027\">Yeremia 36:21–27</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24038001\" data-end-ref=\"24038013\">38:1–13</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003001\" data-end-ref=\"27003030\">Danieli 3:1–30</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27006001\" data-end-ref=\"27006028\">6:1–28</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43008029\" data-end-ref=\"43008029\">Yohana 8:29</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"50002006\" data-end-ref=\"50002011\">Wafilipi 2:6–11</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58005007\" data-end-ref=\"58005010\">Waebrania 5:7–10</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60002013\" data-end-ref=\"60003007\">1 Petro 2:13–3:7</data></p>",
