"title": "Jiwe Walilolikataa Waashi",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "jiwe walilolikataa waashi",
"language": "swh",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Yesu aliwakera viongozi wa Kiyahudi na wafuasi wao mara kwa mara. Ingawa alitoka katika ukoo wa Mfalme Daudi, walitilia shaka sifa ya mama yake (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40001018\" data-end-ref=\"40001025\">Mathayo 1:18–25</data>). Yesu alitoka Nazareti (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40002023\" data-end-ref=\"40002023\">Mathayo 2:23</data>), mahali ambapo pia hapakuwa na sifa nzuri (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40013053\" data-end-ref=\"40013058\">Mathayo 13:53–58</data>). Alifanya kazi hasa Galilaya, mbali na kituo cha mamlaka ya Kiyahudi (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40004012\" data-end-ref=\"40004016\">Mathayo 4:12–16</data>). Rafiki yake wa karibu alikuwa Yohana, ambaye alijulikana kwa kubatiza watu na kuzungumza kwa ujasiri dhidi ya viongozi wa kisiasa kama nabii (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40011002\" data-end-ref=\"40011019\">Mathayo 11:2–19</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40014003\" data-end-ref=\"40014012\">14:3–12</data>).</p><p>Yesu mara nyingi alitoa majibu yasiyo ya moja kwa moja (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40013010\" data-end-ref=\"40013015\">Mathayo 13:10–15</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40017024\" data-end-ref=\"40017027\">17:24–27</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40019003\" data-end-ref=\"40019012\">19:3–12</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40021023\" data-end-ref=\"40021027\">21:23–27</data>). Alikataa kuonyesha ishara za miujiza ili kuthibitisha madai yake (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40012038\" data-end-ref=\"40012042\">12:38–42</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40016001\" data-end-ref=\"40016004\">16:1–4</data>). Alitumia muda na watu ambao jamii ilikuwa imewakataa (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40009009\" data-end-ref=\"40009013\">9:9–13</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40011016\" data-end-ref=\"40011019\">11:16–19</data>). Alipinga desturi za Kiyahudi (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40005017\" data-end-ref=\"40005020\">5:17–20</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40009014\" data-end-ref=\"40009017\">9:14–17</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40012001\" data-end-ref=\"40012014\">12:1–14</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40015001\" data-end-ref=\"40015020\">15:1–20</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40021012\" data-end-ref=\"40021013\">21:12–13</data>). Aliepuka kutambuliwa hadharani (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40008004\" data-end-ref=\"40008004\">8:4</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40012015\" data-end-ref=\"40012021\">12:15–21</data>).</p><p>Alishiriki maarifa yake na watu ambao hawakutarajiwa (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40011025\" data-end-ref=\"40011027\">Mathayo 11:25–27</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40013016\" data-end-ref=\"40013017\">13:16–17</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40016013\" data-end-ref=\"40016020\">16:13–20</data>). Alizungumza kuhusu kifo cha aibu ambacho angekumbana nacho (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40016021\" data-end-ref=\"40016021\">16:21</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40017022\" data-end-ref=\"40017023\">17:22–23</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40020018\" data-end-ref=\"40020019\">20:18–19</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40026002\" data-end-ref=\"40026002\">26:2</data>). Yesu hakutafuta umakini au kufanya jukumu lake liwe wazi. Badala yake, alichagua unyenyekevu, faragha, na kushiriki ufunuo ambao watu wangeweza kuelewa tu kupitia imani.</p><p>Mwishowe, Yesu alithibitishwa kuwa sahihi. Alishinda mabishano (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42020020\" data-end-ref=\"42020040\">Luka 20:20–40</data>). Aliondoa pepo waliokuwa wakidhibiti watu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40008028\" data-end-ref=\"40008034\">Mathayo 8:28–34</data>). Aliponya watu kwa njia za kushangaza (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40009001\" data-end-ref=\"40009008\">Mathayo 9:1–8</data>). Aliwafufua watu kutoka kwa wafu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40009018\" data-end-ref=\"40009026\">Mathayo 9:18–26</data>). Hatimaye, alifufuka kutoka kwa wafu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40028001\" data-end-ref=\"40028010\">Mathayo 28:1–10</data>). Huduma yake ilisababisha mgawanyiko lakini ilikuwa na ufanisi katika kuanzisha Ufalme wa Mungu duniani (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40011002\" data-end-ref=\"40011006\">Mathayo 11:2–6</data>).</p><p><u>Sehemu za Kujifunza Zaidi</u></p><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23003008\" data-end-ref=\"23003008\">Isaya 3:8</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23008014\" data-end-ref=\"23008015\">8:14–15</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23028012\" data-end-ref=\"23028013\">28:12–13</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23059009\" data-end-ref=\"23059010\">59:9–10</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24013016\" data-end-ref=\"24013016\">Yeremia 13:16</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24020011\" data-end-ref=\"24020011\">20:11</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24031007\" data-end-ref=\"24031009\">31:7–9</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24050031\" data-end-ref=\"24050032\">50:31–32</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"28004004\" data-end-ref=\"28004006\">Hosea 4:4–6</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"28005005\" data-end-ref=\"28005005\">5:5</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"28014009\" data-end-ref=\"28014009\">14:9</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"39002007\" data-end-ref=\"39002009\">Malaki 2:7–9</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40011005\" data-end-ref=\"40011006\">Mathayo 11:5–6</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40013054\" data-end-ref=\"40013058\">13:54–58</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40017027\" data-end-ref=\"40017027\">17:27</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40021042\" data-end-ref=\"40021046\">21:42–46</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41006003\" data-end-ref=\"41006003\">Marko 6:3</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42020017\" data-end-ref=\"42020019\">Luka 20:17–19</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43006060\" data-end-ref=\"43006069\">Yohana 6:60–69</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45009030\" data-end-ref=\"45009033\">Warumi 9:30–33</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45011007\" data-end-ref=\"45011012\">11:7–12</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45014012\" data-end-ref=\"45014013\">14:12–13</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45014020\" data-end-ref=\"45014021\">20–21</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46001021\" data-end-ref=\"46001023\">1 Wakorintho 1:21–23</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46008009\" data-end-ref=\"46008013\">8:9–13</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46010031\" data-end-ref=\"46011001\">10:31–11:1</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"47006003\" data-end-ref=\"47006003\">2 Wakorintho 6:3</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"48005011\" data-end-ref=\"48005011\">Wagalatia 5:11</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60002005\" data-end-ref=\"60002008\">1 Petro 2:5–8</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"62002010\" data-end-ref=\"62002010\">1 Yohana 2:10</data></p>",
